{{--
    The Akukas mark: a hand, a spiral and a sparkle. Supplied as vector artwork rather than
    converted from the launcher icon, so this is the authoritative copy — the Android
    ic_launcher_foreground.xml is the one derived from it, not the other way round.

    Fills with currentColor so the page picks the colour per theme; the app's dark palette
    lightens the terracotta to #FFB4A8 rather than keeping the light-mode value on a dark ground.
--}}
